sample_frames.py:
samples one frame of each of the videos (at 50% of the video length), pads them with black pixels to make them square
and saves them to frames_to_annotate_larger (will be annotated using a grading csv)

annotation_app_video.py:
takes the frames in frames_to_annotate_larger and starts an annotation script that allows to create annotations_video_frames_larger.csv

segmentation_pipeline.py:
takes both the sampled frames and the annotations to train five Unet++ (B4 backbone) models (saved in models) on
five different splits (saved in cv_splits.json)

segment_frames.py:
takes a folder of sampled frames, crops them and saves the results to another folder.
